CHAPTER 2 — Delta Lake Introduced (2016) 🦸
What is Delta Lake?
"Delta Lake is an open source storage layer that sits ON TOP of your existing Data Lake and adds reliability, performance and ACID capabilities to it"
Before Delta Lake:          After Delta Lake:

S3/ADLS (Plain Parquet)     S3/ADLS
        ↓                       ↓
